      "original_line": "- [ ] **M6.B5L.FAN.INNER.L134.D** Entire D-leaf type at fan inner path vertex2 with block loads134; retain the full side-interior root slider and every block mask, force, mean and three-extra completion under M6.B5L.RETAINED_CONTRACT.",
