      "accepted_line": "- [x] **M6.B5L.HOUSE.HUB.LTCB.D** CLOSED by D_LEAF_TWO_BOUNDARY_THETA_BRANCHES_AND_HOUSE_HUB_TCB_COMPLETE_EXCLUSION.md. The actual theta paths A--T--D, AD and A--B--C--D, with protected exterior access of T,B and the genuine D leaf, contradict the full A4 shallow-root force and moment equations; the full-window outward-cap theorem removes every East nonleaf axis without assuming a B--D contact. All root margins must exceed one quarter, and the eight actual other unit interiors then give disjoint radius-5/4 arcs of total angular length greater than a full turn. The entire original D slider, all A4/D3/T2/B2/C2/L1 forces, original masks, zero weights, normal owners, mean endpoints, both radii and all three arbitrary completing units are retained. Complete root and separate independent reviews passed; no new ID or coarse closure is claimed."
    }
